# @hub-lanes

# ── LESSON-MEASURE LANE (BH-5808, BH-5794.3) ───────────────────────────────
# Daily at 07:23 (after lesson-propose at 06:41) it records each merged lesson
# of the lesson_proposal ledger in the `lessons` table, files ONE stronger-stage
# ai-build issue per not-working lesson, and opens ONE PR that removes a §10
# plan lesson a later check supersedes. Once per ISO week (ledger kind
# lesson_measure) it judges each lesson (BLOCK rate per 100 reviewed PRs, 14
# days before and after), runs the retention dry run, and sends the digest
# through bin/archie-tg-send.sh. No model call; it never merges. flock -n dedupes.
# Off: LESSON_MEASURE_ENABLED=0, flags/lane-off-lesson-measure, or
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off lesson-measure.
23 7 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/lesson-measure.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
